    "notes": [
      "1. The BusMatrix is automatically active when at least one master is ON (CPU, DMA).",
      "2. The GPIOx (x= A…H) dynamic current consumption is approximately divided by a factor two versus this table values when the GPIO port is locked thanks to LCKK and LCKy bits in the GPIOx_LCKR register. In order to save the full GPIOx current",
      "3. The AHB to APB1 Bridge is automatically active when at least one peripheral is ON on the APB1.",
      "4. The AHB to APB2 Bridge is automatically active when at least one peripheral is ON on the APB2. The consumption for the peripherals when using SMPS can be found using STM32CubeMX"
